   "line": [
    "f5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Here's the key: not Bf5, which runs into the nasty Nh4 hitting the bishop and toppling the whole construction. Instead f5 — the Pillsbury knight. Pawns are the best defenders of a piece, and now the e4-knight is a rock.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Anchor an advanced knight with a pawn, not a piece; a pawn-defended outpost can't be dislodged."
