   ],
   "spoken": "Now the strike: the knight on e4 is a type-two piece, and the queen already x-rays it through the pawn — so push the pawn to e5, occupying the centre while keeping the knight supported. If White replies f3, we take on d4 with devastating consequences to his loose king.",
